# todas as chamadas passam pelo gateway (8080)

# ============ CATALOG-SERVICE ============

### Listar jogos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/games

### Buscar jogo por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/games/1

### Cadastrar jogo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Celeste",
  "genre": "Plataforma",
  "platform": "PC",
  "releaseYear": 2018,
  "developer": "Extremely OK Games"
}

### Atualizar jogo
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/games/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild",
  "genre": "Aventura / Mundo aberto",
  "platform": "Switch",
  "releaseYear": 2017,
  "developer": "Nintendo"
}

### Remover jogo
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/games/5

# ============ REVIEW-SERVICE ============

### Listar resenhas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews

### Resenhas de um jogo
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/game/2

### Resumo (nota media + total) de um jogo
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/game/2/summary

### Criar resenha (o review-service valida o jogo no catalog-service)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gameId": 2,
  "author": "Everton",
  "rating": 5,
  "text": "Dificil na medida certa, mundo aberto impressionante.",
  "pros": ["exploracao", "chefes marcantes"],
  "cons": ["curva de aprendizado ingreme"],
  "platform": "PC",
  "hoursPlayed": 120
}

### Criar resenha de jogo inexistente -> 422
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gameId": 999,
  "author": "Everton",
  "rating": 3,
  "text": "esse jogo nao existe no catalogo"
}

# ============ INFRA ============

### Servicos registrados no Eureka
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

### Estado do circuit breaker do review-service
### (derrube o catalog-service e crie algumas resenhas pra ver o circuito abrir)
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/circuitbreakers
